  {
   "id": "elq4c6i1v4zua6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1900,
   "y": 1520,
   "width": 756.0000000000001,
   "height": 168.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1343076642,
   "version": 2,
   "versionNonce": 1360754377,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Circuit breaker in every caller: 3 failures on one instance within HTTP_TIMEOUT_MS × 3.5\n   (the timeout of the wrapped call) → trip, log, report the instance (X-Instance-Id)\n   → Service Discovery marks it removed and the Gateway stops routing to it.\n• Replicas register their container hostname, so each instance has its own URL;\n   state lives in the service's database, never only in one instance's memory.\n• Discord DMs runs as one instance: :3008 is published to the host, and a message sent\n   to one replica would not reach sockets connected to another.\n• Service Discovery is the one REST exception to \"everything through the Gateway\":\n   the Gateway depends on it, so registration cannot depend on the Gateway.",
   "originalText": "• Circuit breaker in every caller: 3 failures on one instance within HTTP_TIMEOUT_MS × 3.5\n   (the timeout of the wrapped call) → trip, log, report the instance (X-Instance-Id)\n   → Service Discovery marks it removed and the Gateway stops routing to it.\n• Replicas register their container hostname, so each instance has its own URL;\n   state lives in the service's database, never only in one instance's memory.\n• Discord DMs runs as one instance: :3008 is published to the host, and a message sent\n   to one replica would not reach sockets connected to another.\n• Service Discovery is the one REST exception to \"everything through the Gateway\":\n   the Gateway depends on it, so registration cannot depend on the Gateway.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
